      "text": "@scene_meta_focus: Burnt-red desert Giants resist Needle construction, killing forty Reptilians; Overseer Enlil deploys three hundred additional warriors, and an ancient sandstone Giant dies destroying foundation work."
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "@scene_meta_continuity: 2 years, 5 months, 19 days after the first blood at Tidecaller Mountain in scene 007.2"
    },
    {
